 Steve Lieman on Unsplash", "author": "Steve Lieman", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stevelieman?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-little-girl-playing-in-the-grass-XeFzJmAjRxY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(27, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(65, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "0183c75384c8"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-08", "word_count": 118, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "中国の「双11」セールで、記者が淘宝、JD.com、DouyinのAIに安い店を聞きました。値段は合っていましたが、中古や資源机の店をすすめられる問題が見つかりました。", "lead_zh": "在中国“双11”促销中，记者向淘宝、京东、抖音的AI询问便宜店铺。价格虽然对得上，但也发现了被推荐翻新机或资源机店铺的问题。", "preview": "记者はiPhone 17 ProとAirPods Pro 3など4品を各AIに聞きました。AIが出した価格は、実際の商品ページとほぼ同じでした。うその値段はありませんでした。", "preview_zh": "记者向各AI询问了iPhone 17 Pro和AirPods Pro 3等4件商品。AI给出的价格与实际商品页面基本一致，没有虚假价格。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 890, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/91/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 11.8, "size_bytes": 169488, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 54, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@2fb5b45/content/data/versions/907.json"}], "ja_n3": [{"content_hash": "ceeae8515c3719ad", "version_id": 908, "article_id": 91, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "淘宝とJD.comのAIに買い物を任せたら、安い値段の裏側が見えてきた", "title_zh": "把购物交给淘宝和京东的AI，结果看清了低价背后的门道", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8196807.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1657049016607-0a376708752f?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8aGVscGVycyUyMGZhaWwlMjBmaW5kfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQwOTkwNzJ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Steve Lieman on Unsplash", "author": "Steve Lieman", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stevelieman?utm_so